<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia hails China's Deng.</title>
<headline>Tunisia hails China's Deng.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisian President Zine al-Abidine Ben Ali on Thursday hailed Deng Xiaoping as a great leader who guided China to a new era of prosperity.</p>
<p>&quot;We in Tunisia recall with respect and admiration his contribution to peace...and his great accomplishments and political, economic and social reforms which permitted China to enter a new era of prosperity, rapid and steady economic growth,&quot; he said in a letter to Chinese President Jiang Zemin.</p>
<p>Deng died on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
